    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_unique_vector" kindref="compound">UniqueVector</ref> - This class produces a sequential <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref> number (base 1) for each unique entry that is added. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>T is the type of entries in the vector. This class should have an implementation of operator== and of operator&lt;. Entries can be fetched using operator[] with the entry <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
